licensed under Apache-2.0; the text is in LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt.
Changed by Ohm Lab: exported to ONNX and quantised to int8.

Trained on InsightFace's refined MS-Celeb-1M (faces_ms1m_112x112), which
InsightFace provides, with the models trained on it, for non-commercial
research purposes only. See README.md.
